# Python bytecode. These were tracked until 2026-08-06 (they arrived with
# "Bring existing sources green under the new hooks", 5564128) and dirtied the
# working tree on every import — merely running the launch-file helpers or the
# test suite rewrites them, which repeatedly showed up as uncommitted changes
# on field hosts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
